  "body_html": "<h1>mix_gt_of_gt_nbh</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem mix_gt_of_gt_nbh (x y c : 𝕜) (H : c &lt; x) : ∃ t : 𝕜, 0 &lt; t ∧ t &lt; 1 ∧ c &lt; t * x + (1 - t) * y</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n</ul>",
